# Dashboard & Panel Design System (Canonical Reference)

Use the **Warehouse Panel** as the main UI reference for admin, manager, and internal dashboard pages.

**Live reference implementation:**
- Pages: `front_end/src/pages/warehouse-manager/` (Dashboard, Inventory, Approvals, Issues)
- Shared styles: `front_end/src/styles/pages/warehouse-manager/WarehousePanel.css`
- Layout shell: `front_end/src/styles/layouts/AdminLayout.css` + `front_end/src/styles/layouts/Sidebar.css`
- Header component: `front_end/src/components/PageHeader.js`
- Shared tokens/patterns: `front_end/src/styles/shared/PageDesign.css`, `front_end/src/styles/App.css`

Customer/storefront pages still follow `.cursor/rules/home-design-system.mdc`. Panel pages follow this rule.

## Scope & naming
- Wrap panel pages in: `admin-page-shell` + page-scoped prefix (e.g. `wm-page`, future `panel-page` or `{role}-page`)
- **Always use page-scoped CSS prefixes** (`wm-*`, `panel-*`, `admin-*`) — never generic class names like `.card` or `.stat-card` without a prefix
- Max content width: **1200px** centered inside admin content area (1400px shell)
- i18n: all visible strings via `useTranslation()` / `t('ui.pages...')` keys in `front_end/src/locales/{en,ar,fr}/common.json`

## Layout structure
```
admin-page-shell {prefix}-page
  PageHeader (kicker → Fraunces title → subtitle; optional actions slot)
  section.{prefix}-section (repeat per block)
    {prefix}-section-header (h2 + optional description)
    content (grid | toolbar | data-panel | list | empty)
```

- **Vertical page gap:** `4rem` between major blocks (`2.5rem` on mobile)
- **Section internal gap:** `1.5rem`
- **Scroll anchor:** `scroll-margin-top: 5rem` on headers
- **No hero gradient bands** on standard panel pages — use plain `PageHeader` on page background (hero bands are optional, Home/customer only unless explicitly requested)

## Typography
- **UI/body:** Space Grotesk (`'Space Grotesk', 'Segoe UI', sans-serif`)
- **Headlines / card titles / stat values:** Fraunces
- **Page kicker:** uppercase, `letter-spacing: 0.18–0.2em`, `0.75–0.8rem`, semibold, `var(--primary-color)` via `.page-kicker`
- **Page title (h1):** `clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.2rem)`, `-0.02em` letter-spacing, Fraunces
- **Section title (h2):** `1.35rem`, `-0.01em` letter-spacing, Fraunces
- **Subtitle / meta:** `var(--text-secondary)`, max-width ~640px, `0.95–1rem`
- **Table headers:** uppercase, `0.72rem`, `letter-spacing: 0.1em`, semibold, secondary color

## Color palette & tokens
Always prefer CSS variables from `App.css` — never hardcode when a token exists.

| Role | Token / value |
|------|----------------|
| Primary | `--primary-color` `#2563eb`, hover `--primary-hover` `#1d4ed8` |
| Surfaces | `--surface`, `--background` |
| Text | `--text-primary`, `--text-secondary` |
| Borders | `--border-color` `#e2e8f0` (dark: `#334155`) |
| Shadows | `--shadow`, `--shadow-md`, `--shadow-lg` |
| Focus ring | `--control-focus-ring` / `rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.15)` |
| Success action | `#16a34a` / hover `#15803d` |
| Warning stat | `#d97706` on `rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12)` |
| Error stat | `#dc2626` on `rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.12)` |
| Info stat | `var(--primary-color)` on `rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.12)` |

**Icon boxes:** 52×52px, `border-radius: 1rem`, tinted background at ~12% opacity, icon color matches semantic hue.

## Sidebar (panel navigation)
Match `Sidebar.css` + `Sidebar.js` patterns:
- Fixed width **250px**, `var(--surface)` bg, `1px` border toward content edge
- Title: Fraunces `1.25rem`; reorder hint in secondary `0.78rem`
- Links: flex row, icon + label, `0.85rem 1.5rem` padding, pill radius on trailing edge (`border-radius: 0 999px 999px 0`)
- **Active state:** `var(--background)` fill + **3px primary accent** on start edge (mirror for RTL)
- Hover: background + primary text color; transition `0.3s ease`
- Badges: small red pill, absolute top-right (mirror for RTL)
- **≤1024px:** horizontal scroll nav, bottom accent border on active item
- Menu labels via i18n keys (`ui.sidebar.menu.*`, `ui.sidebar.panel.*`)

## Cards, surfaces & borders
Standard card / panel recipe (stats, actions, list items, toolbars):
- `background: var(--surface)`
- `border: 1px solid var(--border-color)`
- `border-radius: 1.2rem`
- `box-shadow: var(--shadow)`
- `padding: 1.25–1.75rem`
- **Hover (clickable):** `translateY(-4px to -5px)`, `--shadow-md`, border tint `rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2–0.25)`

**Stat cards:** number + label on one side, semantic icon box on opposite side (`justify-content: space-between` in `.stat-top`).

**Action cards:** horizontal layout — icon box | title + description | arrow; equal height grid (`repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr))` desktop, 1 col mobile); min-height ~132px.

**Data panel:** wrapped table/list inside `.wm-data-panel` — rounded container, no double borders on outer edge.

**Empty state:** dashed border, centered icon + message, `4rem 2rem` padding.

## Grids & spacing
- Stats: `repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr))`, gap `1.25rem`
- Actions: 3 equal columns desktop; `1fr` stack ≤768px
- Toolbar: flex, space-between; filters grouped inline; pill inputs
- List cards: vertical stack, gap `0.85rem`

## Forms, filters & controls
- **Text/select inputs:** height `42px`, pill radius `999px`, `var(--background)` fill, `1px` border
- **Focus:** primary border + 3px focus ring — no default outline
- **Primary button:** pill, `var(--primary-color)`, semibold; hover lift `-2px`
- **Success button:** green pill variant for approve/resolve actions
- **Save inline button:** small primary pill in table rows
- **Tabs:** pill tab bar (`.wm-pill-tabs`) — inactive transparent, active filled primary; count badges as small pills

## Motion & UX
- CSS transitions: **`0.3s ease`** for hover/cards; **`0.2s ease`** for buttons/inputs
- Framer Motion: subtle entrance (`opacity 0→1`, `y: 10–20`), stagger ~`0.03–0.08s`, hover scale ≤`1.02`
- CTA arrows slide on hover; **RTL:** mirror arrow with `scaleX(-1)` and reverse translate
- Loading: centered spinner in `.wm-page-loading` / `.page-loading`, min-height ~400px

## Page patterns (reuse before inventing)
| Pattern | Reference |
|---------|-----------|
| Dashboard + stats + quick actions | `WarehouseManagerDashboard.js` |
| Filter toolbar + data table | `WarehouseInventory.js` |
| Expandable approval cards | `WarehouseApprovals.js` |
| Pill tabs + issue cards + resolve form | `WarehouseIssues.js` |
| Page header with actions | `PageHeader` + `WarehouseIssues.js` tabs |

## Dark mode
- Override surfaces/borders under `.dark` in page CSS — keep using tokens
- Never put `var(--text-primary)` on light overlay backgrounds in dark mode
- Stat/action cards: preserve semantic icon tint backgrounds at ~12–15% opacity

## Responsiveness
- **≤768px:** reduce page gap to `2.5rem`; stack toolbars; single-column action grid; horizontal scroll for wide tables inside data panel
- **≤1024px:** sidebar becomes top horizontal nav; admin content full width, reduced padding
- Use logical properties (`margin-inline`, `text-align: start`, `padding-inline`) for Arabic/RTL

## When building new panel pages
1. Copy structure from closest Warehouse Panel page
2. Import / extend `WarehousePanel.css` patterns (or extract shared `panel-*` equivalents)
3. Use `PageHeader` with panel kicker + title + subtitle
4. Add i18n keys for en, ar, fr together
5. Match premium look: soft corners, subtle depth, restrained motion, no flat/unstyled tables or raw HTML controls
